## vitals batch 相关约定

- PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB：`ON CONFLICT` 唯一键须含分区列 `ts`
- 模型：[`server/backend/app/vitals_models.py`](../../server/backend/app/vitals_models.py) — `UniqueConstraint(..., "ts", ...)`
- API：[`server/backend/app/vitals_api.py`](../../server/backend/app/vitals_api.py) — 每行 `SessionLocal.begin()` 独立事务
- 启动索引：[`server/backend/app/database.py`](../../server/backend/app/database.py) — `_ensure_vitals_dedup_indexes()`
- Schema/约束变更后需 `docker compose down -v` 再 up（会清空 PG 卷）；仅 Python 逻辑变更 **不需要** `down -v`

验证写入：

```bash
curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1/api/vitals/batch \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"deviceId":"test001","source":"LIVE_STREAM","table":"hr_samples","rows":[{"clientRowId":"r1","ts":1718000001000,"bpm":75,"rr_ms":810}]}'
```

成功：`"inserted":1`（非 0）。

